appB_content.append('| `endOfDay(inc)` | Date | End of day timestamp: `updated <= endOfDay()` |')
appB_content.append('| `startOfWeek()` | Date | First day of current week: `resolved >= startOfWeek()` |')
appB_content.append('| `startOfMonth()` | Date | First day of current month: `created >= startOfMonth()` |')
appB_content.append('| `issueHistory()` | Issue Keys | Issues recently viewed by user: `id IN issueHistory()` |')
appB_content.append('| `watchedIssues()` | Issue Keys | Issues watched by user: `id IN watchedIssues()` |')

